WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.436
&gt;&gt;&gt; UKRAINE IS DENYING RUSSIA'S
UNSUPPORTED ALLEGATION THAT

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:07.040
UKRAINE IS PREPARING TO USE A
SO-CALLED DIRTY BOMB ON ITS OWN

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.076
TERRITORY, THAT KIND OF DEVICE
CONTAINS RADIOACTIVE MATERIAL

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.912
BUT IS FAR LESS POWERFUL THAN A
NUCLEAR BOMB.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:16.182
RUSSIA'S DEFENSE MINISTER MADE
THE CLAIM DURING CALLS WITH HIS

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:19.452
WESTERN COUNTERPARTS INCLUDING
U.S. SECRETARY OF DEFENSE LLOYD

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.653
AUSTIN.
UKRAINE SAYS THIS IS AN ATTEMPT

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:24.224
BY MOSCOW TO SIMPLY ESCALATE THE
WAR WITH RUSSIAN MISSILES AND

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:27.527
DRONES TARGETING THE COUNTRY'S
ELECTRICITY AND HEATING

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:30.463
NETWORKS, THE UKRAINIAN
PRESIDENT IS WARNING ONCE AGAIN

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:34.167
OF A DARK COLD WINTER AHEAD.
MORE THAN A MILLION AND A HALF

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:37.270
ENERGY CUSTOMERS DIDN'T HAVE
POWER OVER THE WEEKEND.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:40.907
CNN'S CLARISSA WARD WAS AT THE
SITE OF ANOTHER STRIKE EARLY

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:50.350
TODAY IN MYKOLALV.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: TWO S-300 MISSILES,

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.852
ONE LANDING RIGHT BEHIND ME, YOU
CAN SEE THE SIZE OF THAT CRATER

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:56.856
AND THEN THE SECOND LITERALLY
SLAMMING RIGHT INTO THAT

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:59.159
APARTMENT BUILDING.
NO ONE HERE CAN SEEM TO WORK OUT

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:01.895
WHAT THE TARGET WAS.
THIS IS A RESIDENTIAL AREA,

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:03.095
THERE'S APARTMENT BUILDINGS ALL
AROUND.

00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:07.734
I WANT TO SHOW YOU OVER THERE
THIS IS A CHILDREN'S PLAYGROUND.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.869
OKAY?
YOU CAN SEE WHAT'S LEFT OF T

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:13.573
NOW, THE STRIKE HAPPENED IN THE
EARLY HOURS OF THE MORNING AS I

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:17.643
MENTIONED, SO NO CHILDREN WERE
OUT PLAYING, BUT I THINK IT

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:25.118
GIVES YOU A FEEL FOR JUST HOW
CHALLENGING IT IS.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:28.087
&gt;&gt; AND CERTAINLY RAISES A LOT OF
QUESTIONS BECAUSE WE'VE SEEN

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:30.223
PLAYGROUNDS TARGETED IN THE
PAST.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:36.963
GENERAL ME NOW RETYRRELL GENERAL
MARK HERTLING.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:42.035
GOOD TO SEE YOU AS ALWAYS.
LET'S PICK UP SO WE SAW, RIGHT,

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:45.572
THERE'S CLARISSA IN MYKOLALV.
I DON'T KNOW IF IT'S TECHNICALLY

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:48.208
A BACK AND FORTH.
WE'RE HEARING FROM RUSSIA

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:52.612
UKRAINE IS GOING TO USE A DIRTY
BOMB, UKRAINE PUSHES BACK.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:55.748
YOU HAVE THE COMMANDER OF GROUND
FORCES IN UKRAINE SAYING THE

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:59.519
ISSUE IS THAT WE ARE AND SHOULD
BE WORRIED ABOUT PUTIN USING

00:01:59.519 --> 00:02:01.387
NUCLEAR WEAPONS.
OFFICIALS ON BOTH SIDES ARE

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:04.958
GOING TO PUT THINGS OUT BECAUSE
THEY WANT TO CRAFT A NARRATIVE.

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:08.695
WHAT TO YOU WHEN YOU HEAR ALL OF
THOSE STATEMENTS, WHAT DO YOU IS

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:12.665
THE REAL STORY THERE?
&gt;&gt; WELL, WHEN YOU COMBINE THIS,

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:14.100
ER
ERICA, TO WHAT IS HAPPENING ON

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:17.437
THE BATTLEFIELD, YOU KIND OF PUT
TOGETHER THE NARRATIVE THAT

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:20.540
RUSSIA IS SCRAMBLING RIGHT NOW.
THEY HAVE OPENED UP

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:24.644
COMMUNICATIONS AGAIN, THEY HAVE
NOT DONE THAT WITH SECRETARY

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:27.580
AUSTIN, HE IS THE ONLY ONE THAT
RUSSIA HAS BEEN TALKING TO OVER

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:32.385
THE LAST SEVERAL MONTHS, THE
LAST TIME THAT GENERAL MILLEY

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:38.958
TALKED TO THE LEADER OF THE
RUSSIAN MILITARY WAS MONTHS AGO.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:41.127
SO THEY'RE TRYING TO ESTABLISH
AS YOU JUST SAID THAT NARRATIVE,

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:44.664
BUT THEN YOU COMBINE THAT WITH
WHAT IS HAPPENING ON THE

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:50.636
BATTLEFIELD AND, YOU KNOW,
TRUTHFULLY THERE'S ONLY ONE

00:02:50.636 --> 00:02:52.939
DOCTRINE TERM TO USE FOR THIS
AND IT'S SCRAMBLING.

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:55.708
THE RUSSIANS ARE BEING BEATEN IN
MULTIPLE AREAS AND THEY ARE

00:02:55.708 --> 00:03:00.246
TRYING TO PATCHWORK THEIR
RESPONSES TOGETHER TO CONTINUE

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:03.483
TO TRY TO DRIVE A NARRATIVE THAT
THEY ARE SUCCEEDING.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:06.919
THEY ARE NOT.
THEY ARE BEING BEATEN ON THE

00:03:06.919 --> 00:03:10.156
BATTLEFIELD IN BAKHMUT, WHICH IS
SOMETHING THEY POURED THE

00:03:10.156 --> 00:03:15.695
WAGONER GROUP INTO, THEY'RE
SEEING DEFEATS IN KHERSON, LAST

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:21.000
NIGHT THE UKRAINIAN MILITARY
ACTUALLY LIBERATED DOZENS MORE

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.771
TOWNS IN THAT OBLAST.
SO YOU'RE SEEING THE POTENTIAL

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:29.208
FOR ADDITIONAL BATTLEFIELD
FAILURES WHILE RUSSIA CONTINUES

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:33.246
TO JUST STRIKE CIVILIAN TARGETS,
JUST LIKE CLARISSA JUST SHOWED.

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:37.150
IT'S JUST -- IT'S TROUBLING,
IT'S WAR CRIMES AND IT JUST

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:40.787
GIVES ME THE INDICATION THAT THE
POLITICAL MASTERS IN MOSCOW ARE

00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:44.123
JUST SCRAMBLING TO TRY TO CRAFT
SOME TYPE OF NARRATIVE THAT THEY

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:46.159
CONTINUE TO WIN, WHICH THEY'RE
NOT DOING.

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:49.495
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU TALK ABOUT THE
SCRAMBLING I WAS STRUCK BY SOME

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:52.699
ACCOUNTS THAT WERE GIVEN TO CNN
BY PEOPLE IN KHERSON WHO

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:56.268
UNDERSTANDABLY DIDN'T WANT THEIR
NAMES USED, THEY WERE WORRIED

00:03:56.268 --> 00:03:58.704
ABOUT RETRIBUTION BUT TALKING
ABOUT THE MOVEMENT THEY'RE

00:03:58.704 --> 00:04:01.407
SEEING ON THE GROUND, RUSSIAN
ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICIALS ARE

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:04.043
MOVING OUT, THAT NEW TROOPS WHO
SEEM TO IN THE WORDS OF ONE

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:07.013
PERSON NOT REALLY KNOW WHERE
THEY ARE OR WHAT THEY'RE DOING

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:10.416
SEEM TO BE MOVING IN.
THE MOVES THAT WE'RE SEEING IN

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.853
THAT AREA, YES, COULD BE FURTHER
EVIDENCE OF SCRAMBLING AND

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:17.623
ISSUES, BUT ON A BROADER LEVEL
THIS IS ALSO A REALLY IMPORTANT

00:04:17.623 --> 00:04:20.960
AREA RIGHT NOW.
&gt;&gt; IT IS CRITICALLY IMPORTANT.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:24.797
WHAT YOU'RE SEEING ON THE
RUSSIAN SIDE IS WHAT'S CALLED A

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:28.401
TACTICAL WITHDRAWAL.
THAT'S THE OFFICIAL NAME FOR IT.

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:31.871
AGAIN, A VERY TOUGH MILITARY
OPERATION TO EXECUTE BECAUSE

00:04:31.871 --> 00:04:34.573
YOU'RE LEAVING SOME PEOPLE IN
CONTACT WHILE YOU'RE TRYING TO

00:04:34.573 --> 00:04:36.876
WITHDRAW YOUR TROOPS IN OTHER
PLACES.

00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:40.780
RUSSIANS HAVE BEEN IN TROUBLE IN
KHERSON FOR ABOUT FIVE WEEKS

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:44.217
NOW.
THEY HAVE FORCES ON THE WESTERN

00:04:44.217 --> 00:04:48.221
SIDE OF THE DNIPRO RIVER WHICH
ARE ABOUT TO BE SURROUNDED AND

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:51.624
CAPTURED BY UKRAINIAN FORCES.
THEY HAVE BEEN ATTEMPTING TO

00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:54.227
ENCIRCLE THOSE FORCES FOR
SEVERAL WEEKS NOW.

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:58.264
AND THEY KNOW THAT THEY'VE GOT
TO PULL THE ADMINISTRATIVE

00:04:58.264 --> 00:05:02.001
GOVERNMENT THAT THEY THEN PLACED
AND WHEN I SAY "THEY" I'M

00:05:02.001 --> 00:05:04.370
TALKING ABOUT THE RUSSIANS, THAT
THEY HAVE PLACED OUT OF THAT

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:07.440
AREA DURING A WITHDRAWAL AND
IT'S GOING TO BE CHAOTIC.

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:11.544
SO, YES, THEY HAVE PUT MORE
FORCES IN THERE, BUT THE FORCES

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:13.813
THAT THEY ARE PUTTING IN THERE,
ERICA, ARE THE SAME ONES WE HAVE

00:05:13.813 --> 00:05:17.116
BEEN TALKING ABOUT FOR MONTHS
THAT HAVE BEEN MOBILIZED THAT,

00:05:17.116 --> 00:05:21.854
NUMBER ONE, AREN'T VERY GOOD
AND, NUMBER TWO, THEY'RE JOINING

00:05:21.854 --> 00:05:28.194
UNITS THAT HAVE BEEN MAULED OVER
THE LAST SEVERAL MONTHS SO M

00:05:28.194 --> 00:05:30.663
MORALE IS VERY LOW.
IT'S A DISASTROUS OPERATION

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:34.467
THAT'S BEING CONDUCTED IN THE
SOUTH WHILE AT THE SAME TIME THE

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:36.702
WAGONER GROUP IS STARTING TO
LOSE IN THE NORTHEAST.

00:05:36.702 --> 00:05:40.206
&gt;&gt; REALLY QUICKLY BEFORE I LET
YOU GO, AT THE BEGINNING OF THE

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:42.375
WAR WHEN THERE WAS TARGETING
SPECIFICALLY OF INFRASTRUCTURE

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:45.578
AND SENDING PEOPLE OUT OF
UKRAINE, THERE WAS TALK THAT

00:05:45.578 --> 00:05:48.548
PART OF THIS PLAN, RIGHT, WITH
AS TO FLED EUROPE AND THE WEST

00:05:48.548 --> 00:05:52.552
WITH REFUGEES, TO BREAK DOWN
SOME OF THE SUPPORT FOR UKRAINE.

00:05:52.552 --> 00:05:54.787
COULD SOME OF THAT
INFRASTRUCTURE TARGETING BE AN

00:05:54.787 --> 00:05:59.025
EFFORT BY PUTIN TO DO THE SAME
THING NOW HEADING INTO WINTER?

00:05:59.025 --> 00:06:01.360
&gt;&gt; OH, IT'S CERTAINLY DOING
THAT.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:04.197
THAT'S EXACTLY WHAT HE IS DOING.
HE IS CREATING -- OR ATTEMPT TO

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:07.633
GO CREATE A HUMANITARIAN
DISASTER WITHOUT HEAT, WITHOUT

00:06:07.633 --> 00:06:11.037
WATER, WITHOUT ELECTRICITY.
ALL THOSE THINGS THAT A CIVILIAN

00:06:11.037 --> 00:06:13.739
POPULATION DEPENDS ON.
BUT WHAT WE ARE FINDING

00:06:13.739 --> 00:06:17.610
INTERESTING IN KHERSON IS AS
RUSSIA IS TELLING THE CITIZENS

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:21.214
OF KHERSON TO GO EAST AND GET
OUT OF THE AREA BECAUSE THEY ARE

00:06:21.214 --> 00:06:24.050
AFRAID THAT THEY MIGHT BE
INJURED, AT LEAST THAT'S WHAT

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.619
THEY'RE SAYING, MANY OF THE
RESIDENTS ARE STAYING THERE.

00:06:26.619 --> 00:06:30.623
IT'S ALMOST LIKE THE DECISION DO
YOU STAY OR LEAVE DURING A

00:06:30.623 --> 00:06:32.225
HURRICANE.
YOU KNOW, ARE YOU GOING TO BE

00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:36.562
THERE WHEN THE BATTLEFIELD
HAPPENS TO BE INCREASINGLY

00:06:36.562 --> 00:06:39.732
INTENSE OVER YOUR HOUSE?
THAT'S WHAT'S HAPPENING AND WHAT

00:06:39.732 --> 00:06:44.203
WE'RE SEEING IS MANY UKRAINIAN
CITIZENS ARE COUNTERING THAT

00:06:44.203 --> 00:06:48.774
THREAT BY STAYING IN THEIR HOMES
IN THE KHERSON REGION, WHICH IS

00:06:48.774 --> 00:06:50.609
JUST PHENOMENAL.
BUT THE WINTER IS GETTING

00:06:50.609 --> 00:06:53.279
TOUGHER, IT'S STARTING TO GET
MUCH COLDER NOW AND WITHOUT

00:06:53.279 --> 00:06:55.181
ELECTRICITY AND HEAT IT'S GOING
TO BE DIFFICULT.

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:57.449
&gt;&gt; IT CERTAINLY WILL.
LIEUTENANT GENERAL MARK

00:06:57.449 --> 00:06:58.851
HERTLING, ALWAYS APPRECIATE YOUR
INSIGHT.

00:06:58.851 --> 00:07:00.920
THANK YOU.
FREDERIK PLEITGEN IS LIVE IN

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.788
ZAPORIZHZHIA, UKRAINE WITH THE
LATEST.

00:07:02.788 --> 00:07:05.391
FRED, WHAT CAN YOU TELL US?
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE BIG QUESTION

00:07:05.391 --> 00:07:09.428
RIGHT NOW HERE IN THE SOUTH OF
UKRAINE AND WHETHER OR NOT THE

00:07:09.428 --> 00:07:14.300
RUSSIANS ARE REALLY REMOVING
THOSE FORCES FROM THAT AREA

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.002
AROUND THE TOWN OF KHERSON.
THERE ARE INDICATIONS THERE

00:07:17.002 --> 00:07:20.740
MIGHT BE A WITHDRAW, THAT MAY
HAVE ALREADY STARTED BUT IT

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:22.208
COULD HAPPEN IN THE NEXT COUPLE
OF DAYS.

00:07:22.208 --> 00:07:26.178
THE HEAD OF UKRAINE'S MILITARY
INTELLIGENCE BELIEVES THE

00:07:26.178 --> 00:07:31.651
RUSSIANS ARE BUILDING UP FORCES,
TELLING CIVILIANS TO LEAVE THE

00:07:31.651 --> 00:07:34.620
AREA.
BEFORE WE WENT TO AIR WE GOT NEW

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.757
INFORMATION FROM THE RUSSIAN
INSTALLED PUPPET AUTHORITIES IN

00:07:37.757 --> 00:07:42.061
THE AREA, CALLING ON THE MEN
STILL IN THE TOWN OF KHERSON TO

00:07:42.061 --> 00:07:45.631
JOIN A TERRITORIAL DEFENSE UNIT.
COULD BE AN INDICATION THAT THE

00:07:45.631 --> 00:07:50.569
RUSSIANS WANT TO MAKE A STAND.
THE UKRAINIANS SAY ON THE

00:07:50.569 --> 00:07:52.471
GROUND, THEY CONTINUE TO MAKE
GAINS IN IN THE SOUTH.

00:07:52.471 --> 00:07:57.743
&gt;&gt; MAKING THIS CLAIM WITHOUT ANY
EVIDENCE THAT UKRAINE HAS SOME

00:07:57.743 --> 00:08:01.280
KIND OF PLANS TO USE A SO-CALLED
DIRTY BOMB.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:06.352
THAT WOULD BE SOME KIND OF BOMB
WITH RADIO ACTIVE RESIDUE

00:08:06.352 --> 00:08:09.121
ATTACHED TO IT.
THE U.S. DISMISSES THIS, WHAT'S

00:08:09.121 --> 00:08:11.023
THE INTERNATIONAL REACTION TO
THIS?

00:08:11.023 --> 00:08:14.327
&gt;&gt; Reporter: FIRST OF ALL, THE
U.S. DISMISSES IT, YOU'RE RIGHT.

00:08:14.327 --> 00:08:17.730
BUT ALSO THE INTERNATIONAL
COMMUNITY MOST DISMISIT AS WELL.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:21.000
IT WAS INTERESTING BECAUSE THE
DEFENSE MINISTER OF RUSSIA, HE

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:24.904
SAID ALL THIS IN A CALL WITH
LLOYD AUSTIN, BUT ALSO WITH THE

00:08:24.904 --> 00:08:29.809
DEFENSE MINISTERS OF FRANCE,
GREAT BRITAIN, AND TURKEY AS

00:08:29.809 --> 00:08:32.011
WELL.
MAKING THESE CLAIMS.

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:36.916
FRANCE, THE U.S. AND BRITAIN
CAME TOGETHER HAD A COMMON

00:08:36.916 --> 00:08:40.653
STATEMENT SAYING THIS IS FALSE
INFORMATION.

00:08:40.653 --> 00:08:43.756
SAYING THEY HOPE THE RUSSIANS
DON'T USE THIS FOR ESCALATION ON

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:46.125
THE BATTLEFIELD OF THEIR OWN.
THE UKRAINIANS ARE SAYING THE

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:50.730
SAME THING, THEY'RE A MEMBER OF
A NONPROLIFERATION TREATY AND

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:54.600
THEY DON'T HAVE ANY NUCLEAR
WEAPONS OR NUCLEAR WEAPONS

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.568
PROGRAM.
THEY BELIEVE THIS IS THE

00:08:55.568 --> 00:08:58.904
RUSSIANS MAKING A MOVE.
IT'S UNCLEAR WHAT'S BEHIND THIS,

00:08:58.904 --> 00:09:02.441
BUT TROUBLING RHETORIC COMING
FROM THE RUSSIAN DEFENSE

00:09:02.441 --> 00:09:04.644
MINISTER P.
&gt;&gt; FREDERIK PLEITGEN FROM

00:09:04.644 --> 00:09:07.980
ZAPORIZHZHIA, STAY SAFE.
THANK YOU.

